     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : ServiceDeSanté svc-cardiologie-1</b></p><a name=\"svc-cardiologie-1\"> </a><a name=\"hcsvc-cardiologie-1\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profil: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-fr-core-healthcare-service.html\">FR Core Healthcare Service Profile</a></p></div><p style=\"border: 1px #661aff solid; background-color: #e6e6ff; padding: 10px;\">Service de cardiologie by HOPITAL INTERCOMMUNAL DE LA PRESQU'ILE G (Entité légale, Secteur non défini) (Identification nationale de structure définie par l’ANS dans le CI_SIS: 2264403106 (use: official)) (urn:oid:1.2.250.1.1.1.1#HOSP-X-CARDIO (use: official))</p><hr/><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"L'enregistrement est actif\">Actif :</td><td>true</td><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"Whether an appointment is required to access this service\">Appointment Required:</td><td>true</td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"The organization that provides this service\">Provided By:</td><td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"Organization-FRCoreOrganizationExample.html\">HOPITAL INTERCOMMUNAL DE LA PRESQU'ILE G (Entité légale, Secteur non défini) (Identification nationale de structure définie par l’ANS dans le CI_SIS: 2264403106 (use: official))</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"Broad category of service being performed or delivered\">Category:</td><td colspan=\"3\"><span title=\"Codes :{http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/service-category 2}\">Aged Care</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"The specialties of the services that are provided\">Specialty:</td><td colspan=\"3\"><span title=\"Codes :{https://mos.esante.gouv.fr/NOS/TRE_R38-SpecialiteOrdinale/FHIR/TRE-R38-SpecialiteOrdinale SM04}\">Cardio et Maladies vasculaires</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"Additional description and/or any specific issues not covered elsewhere\">Comment:</td><td colspan=\"3\">Ce service prend en charge les pathologies cardiaques.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"Ways to make contact\">Coordonnées</td><td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"mailto:cardio@hosp-x.fr\">cardio@hosp-x.fr</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"When the service is (and is not) available\">Availability:</td><td colspan=\"3\"><ul><li>Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday, Friday: 08:00:00 - 17:30:00</li><li>Saturday: 09:00:00 - 12:00:00</li><li>Not available: Fermeture annuelle (2025-08-01 --&gt; 2025-08-31)</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background-color: #f3f5da\" title=\"Cette extension française permet d'associer le type de service avec la durée de ce service.#xA;#xD;This French extension allows to associate the type of service with the duration of this service\">FR Core Service Type Duration Extension:</td><td colspan=\"3\"><ul><li>serviceType: <span title=\"Codes :{https://mos.esante.gouv.fr/NOS/TRE_R38-SpecialiteOrdinale/FHIR/TRE-R38-SpecialiteOrdinale SM04}\">Cardio et Maladies vasculaires</span></li><li>duration: 30 min<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Détails : code UCUMmin = 'min')</span></li></ul></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: HealthcareService svc-cardiologie-1</b></p><a name=\"en-svc-cardiologie-1\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcsvc-cardiologie-1\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style